          <div class="category-tile-card" style="padding: 24px; text-align: left;">
            <span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; background: #fdf2f8; color: #be185d; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase;">Luxury Micro-Drape</span>
