            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Liquid soft touch with fluid drape. Engineered with antimicrobial finishing and wrinkle-release properties that stay sharp through 24-hour shifts without ironing.</p>
